    },
    {
      "beat_id": "beat_007",
      "attaches_to": "state",
      "target_id": "state_003",
      "text": "You've turned an unordered list of 1000 orders into a timeline: 2021-01-05 is your earliest activity, and 2023-11-30 is your latest, both confirmed by the sorted column. Next, you'll filter the Orders table so the country column shows only rows matching a single exact value, like USA, in the filter box.",
